Testing string replace method (beddel):

Basic example:
  Original: Soplang waa fudud
  After replacing 'fudud' with 'xoogan': Soplang waa xoogan

Target doesn't exist:
  Original: Hello World
  After replacing 'Universe' with 'Galaxy': Hello World

Case sensitivity:
  Original: Hello world, hello everyone
  After replacing 'hello' with 'Howdy': Hello world, Howdy everyone

Replace only first occurrence:
  Original: la la la, la la la
  After replacing first 'la' with 'ba': ba la la, la la la

Empty string tests:
  Original: Empty test
  Replace empty string with 'Something': SomethingEmpty test
  Replace 'Empty' with empty string:  test

Practical examples:
  URL path update:
  Original: https://example.com/oldpath/page.html
  Updated: https://example.com/newpath/page.html

  Number formatting:
  Original: 1000000
  Formatted: 1,000000

  Censoring sensitive data:
  Original: This password is secret123, don't share it
  Censored: This password is ********, don't share it

  Correcting typos:
  Original: Salaan, Aduunka!
  Corrected: Salaan, Adduunka!

String replace tests completed!
